click: x=4.325 y=-142.500 z=35.023

[sliver] The 1.25 mm lateral overhangs on the retaining tabs are the flange width beyond the clearance-inset sliding web. They are 1 mm thick, extend only over the two 8 mm end bands, and remain accessible for support removal before installation. The 0.50 mm wall-facing clearance includes 0.25 mm for their supported undersides.
