click: x=-3.700 y=-142.000 z=35.023

[thin] Specified fit sections, both from copper-plugs/README.md:
- The continuous 1 mm interior flange overlaps both slot edges by 1 mm and bears on the shell's recessed inner seat under foam pressure.
- The two 1 mm exterior retaining tabs clear the outside wall by 0.50 mm: 0.25 mm running clearance plus 0.25 mm for their supported undersides.
alternatives: A thicker flange needs a deeper recess in the shell's 3.2 mm wall. Thicker tabs stand further proud of the shell beside the enclosure valve tray, or close the tabs' 0.50 mm clearance.
